  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Middle East Humanitarian Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will deliver integrated emergency support for conflict affected and displaced people in Gaza (oPt) and Lebanon. Through a dual approach of partner-led and direct programming, the DEC funded project will be implemented in the most affected areas focusing on MPCA and food services mainly. The Phase-1 runs from October 17th 2024 to April 30th 2025. Phase-2 will run from May 1st 2025 to October 31 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
